This repository is the architecture hub of the Munarium Governance Platform: the
shared architecture, normative contracts, decision records, invariant catalog,
roadmap and composition evidence for nine open-source components built around
Munarium Server (iokaio/munarium) and Munarium Matrix (iokaio/munarium-matrix).
It contains no runtime component and no copy of any component's implementation.
